==German==

===Etymology===
From a {{bor|de|nds|-}} dialectalism {{m|nds|Ossenpesek|lit=ox pizzle}} from {{m|nds|Pese|t=tendon}}, {{m|nds|Peserik|t=rod}}, as a pizzle was used in the 18th century to beat man and animal.

